@startmindmap
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
caption Resource bounds that keep libcpg's work finite on large or untrusted inputs

*[#F1F3F5] Resource bounds
**[#FFE3E3] Construction
***[#F1F3F5]:max_file_size = 10 MB default
build() rejects larger source before parsing.
build_from_tree (Mode B) skips it —
the caller already owns a bounded tree.;
**[#FFE3E3] Call resolution
***[#F1F3F5]:max_scope_depth = 128
bounds parent and callee-subtree depth
and visited sets cut malformed cycles.;
***[#F1F3F5]:max_candidates_per_name = 64
bounds retained candidate identifiers
without changing the full ambiguity count.;
***[#F1F3F5]:max_calls = 100,000
processes a deterministic NodeId prefix
and leaves later calls untouched.;
**[#FFE3E3] VF2 matching
***[#F1F3F5]:max_matches cap (0 = unlimited default)
short-circuits the state-space search
once the match limit is reached.;
***[#F1F3F5]:strict_kinds / strict_edges
tighten the feasibility test, pruning
infeasible branches earlier.;
**[#FFE3E3] DFG
***[#F1F3F5]:structural AST sweep
one ordinary pass, exactly two loop-body passes,
and a path set that cuts malformed cycles.;
**[#FFE3E3] Slicing
***[#F1F3F5]:max_nodes on backward_slice / forward_slice
bounds the PDG reverse/forward BFS —
returns as soon as the slice reaches the cap.;
@endmindmap
